            "product_description": [
              {
                "value": "Elevate your daily hydration with this Premium Reusable Water Bottle, thoughtfully designed for active lifestyles. The generous 750ml capacity ensures you stay well-hydrated throughout your activities, while the BPA-free construction maintains your water's pure, fresh taste. This versatile bottle features a leak-proof lid that provides peace of mind whether it's in your gym bag, backpack, or on your desk. The lightweight design makes it an ideal companion for all your adventures, from intense workout sessions to long office days. Its practical wide-mouth opening simplifies cleaning and lets you easily add ice cubes for a refreshing cold drink. The durable construction stands up to daily use, while the sleek sports design offers both style and functionality. Whether you're hitting the trails, heading to yoga, or tackling your daily commute, this water bottle delivers reliable performance and convenience in every situation.",
